  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Capacity of Students in Leadership.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This concept note indicates a means through which a proposed capacity building project for youth in leadership positions in schools in Juba Central Equatoria State will be implemented. These series of activities will be implemented for one year with an average of one activity per month. This project is expected to benefit three hundred (300) students selected from various schools. Your donations towards this project will inspire the next generation of students leaders in South Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
